        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Credo in Deum Patrem omnipotentem. Et in Ihesum Christum filium eius, unicum Deum et Dominum nostrum. Qui natus est de Spiritu Sancto et Maria Virgine. Passus sub Pontio Pilato, crucifixus et sepultus. Descendit ad inferna. Tertia die resurrexit viuus a mortuis. Ascendit ad coelos, sedet ad dexteram Dei patris omnipotentis. Inde venturus iudicare viuos et mortuos. Credo in Sanctum Spiritum. Sanctam Ecclesiam Catholicam. Remissionem omnium peccatorum. Carnis huius resurrectionem et vitam aeternam. Amen.",
          "english": "I believe in God the Father almighty, and in Jesus Christ, His only Son, God and our Lord; who was born of the Holy Spirit and the Virgin Mary; suffered under Pontius Pilate, was crucified and buried; descended into hell; on the third day rose alive from the dead; ascended into heaven and sitteth at the right hand of God the Father almighty; from thence He shall come to judge the living and the dead. I believe in the Holy Spirit; the holy Catholic Church; the forgiveness of all sins; the resurrection of this flesh and life everlasting. Amen.",
          "sourcePages": [
            651,
            652
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "prepared",
            "preparedFor": "Sacrum Florilegium",
            "sourcePages": [
              651,
              652
